title: "Data-Centric Trust Pipeline: Reference Implementation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Cavalcanti Pereira"
    given-names: "Carlos Diego"
    affiliation: "Sloan School of Management, Massachusetts Institute of Technology; CESAR School (Recife Center for Advanced Studies and Systems)"
